            <div xml:id="d868">

                <pb facs="1062" n="952" sameAs="frus:frus1931v03/pg952"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.00/11394: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Consul General at Hankow</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Lockhart</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Hankow</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-04-06T16:00:00+08:00">April 6, 1931—4
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received April 6—9:55 a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>32. The following telegram has been sent to the Legation: <quote
                        rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“April 6, 3 p.m. Steamship <hi rendition="#italic">Iling</hi> of Yangtze
                            Rapid Steamship Company was heavily fired upon from both banks river at
                            mileage 60 above Ichang yesterday. Ship was struck many times and one
                            member of Chinese crew badly wounded. This attack tends to confirm
                            recent rumors that Ho Lung’s bandit forces have been driven <pb
                                facs="1063" n="953" xml:id="pg953"/> to the upper river from
                            northwest Hunan. These forces are probably responsible for the attack on
                                <hi rendition="#italic">Ring.</hi></p>
                        <p>Unconfirmed reports are current in Hankow that some fighting took place
                            in Szechuan last week between the Liu Hsiang and Teng Shih-an
                            factions.</p>
                        <p>Repeated to the Department.”</p>
                    </quote></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lockhart</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
